{
  "id": "process_controllers___p__pi___pid",
  "title": "Process Controllers - P, PI & PID",
  "description": "Calculator and visualizer for Proportional (P), Integral (I), and Derivative (D) process controller outputs. Analyze controller responses including P-Controller, I-Controller, D-Controller, and combined PID-Controller behavior.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Process Controllers Overview\n\nThis tool calculates and visualizes the output responses of different process controller types:\n\n- **P-Controller (Proportional)**: Output proportional to error\n- **I-Controller (Integral)**: Output proportional to accumulated error over time\n- **D-Controller (Derivative)**: Output proportional to rate of change of error\n- **PID-Controller**: Combined proportional, integral, and derivative control\n\n### Key Formulas\n\n**P-Controller**: OP = -kP × Er\n\n**I-Controller**: OI = -kI × Σ(Er dt)\n\n**D-Controller**: OD = -kD × dEr/dt\n\n**PID-Controller**: O = OP + OI + OD"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "error",
          "label": "Error (Er)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 10,
          "unit": "%"
        },
        {
          "id": "kp",
          "label": "Proportional Gain (kP)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2,
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "ki",
          "label": "Integral Gain (kI)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.5,
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "kd",
          "label": "Derivative Gain (kD)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "error_rate",
          "label": "Error Rate of Change (dEr/dt)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2,
          "unit": "%/s"
        },
        {
          "id": "error_integral",
          "label": "Error Integral (Σ Er dt)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 25,
          "unit": "% s"
        },
        {
          "id": "proportional_band",
          "label": "Proportional Band (P)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 50,
          "unit": "%"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "op_output",
          "label": "Proportional Output (OP)",
          "formula": "-inputs.kp * inputs.error",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "oi_output",
          "label": "Integral Output (OI)",
          "formula": "-inputs.ki * inputs.error_integral",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "od_output",
          "label": "Derivative Output (OD)",
          "formula": "-inputs.kd * inputs.error_rate",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "pid_output",
          "label": "PID Output (Total)",
          "formula": "(-inputs.kp * inputs.error) + (-inputs.ki * inputs.error_integral) + (-inputs.kd * inputs.error_rate)",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "kp_calculated",
          "label": "Calculated Gain (kP = 100/P)",
          "formula": "100 / inputs.proportional_band",
          "unit": "",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "headers": [
        "Controller Type",
        "Rise Time",
        "Overshoot",
        "Settling Time",
        "Steady State Error"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "P-Controller",
          "Decrease",
          "Increase",
          "Small Change",
          "Decrease"
        ],
        [
          "I-Controller",
          "Decrease",
          "Increase",
          "Increase",
          "Eliminate"
        ],
        [
          "D-Controller",
          "Small Change",
          "Decrease",
          "Decrease",
          "Small Change"
        ]
      ],
      "options": {
        "title": {
          "text": "Controller Response Characteristics"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "trigger": "axis"
        },
        "legend": {
          "data": [
            "Rise Time",
            "Overshoot",
            "Settling Time",
            "Steady State Error"
          ]
        },
        "grid": {
          "left": "3%",
          "right": "4%",
          "bottom": "3%",
          "containLabel": true
        },
        "xAxis": {
          "type": "category",
          "data": [
            "P-Controller",
            "I-Controller",
            "D-Controller"
          ]
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "type": "value",
          "name": "Effect Level"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}